  <title>Accounts overview</title>

  <p><guiseq><gui>Accounting</gui><gui>Accounts overview</gui></guiseq> draws
  how money moves through the books: creating and posting an invoice,
  customer payments and discounts, depositing checks, posting a purchase
  order and paying a vendor, and cancelling an invoice, for both cash based
  and accrual based accounting. Each box names the account that step posts
  to, as set in <link xref="accounts_configuration"/>. Boxes marked
  selectable, such as <gui>Selectable bank account</gui>, are the accounts
  you choose each time in the window concerned.</p>

  <p>The window only shows; it changes nothing.</p>

</page>
